        <mxCell id="platformgrp" value="docs/platform/ — 14 files&#xa;45 of the repository files are byte-identical legacy-compatibility placeholders across platform, control-plane, phases, etc.&#xa;Some placeholder paths are referenced by scripts / installer / plugins.&#xa;Future: archive/legacy-compatibility/ only after references migrate." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E5E7EB;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="330" width="550" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
