        <mxCell id="phasesgrp" value="docs/phases/ — 15 files&#xa;A2.1–A2.9 plans, reconciliation and completion reports.&#xa;All are identical legacy-compatibility placeholders: SUPERSEDED, retained for history.&#xa;Future: archive/legacy-compatibility/phases/." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E5E7EB;strokeColor=#9CA3AF;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="1100" y="330" width="460" height="165" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
