        <mxCell id="apigrp" value="docs/api/ — 7 files&#xa;Five Channel API Markdown files are runtime product assets.&#xa;Frontend ChannelDocs imports them raw; Dockerfile copies them into image.&#xa;SOURCE_WORKSPACE_API and UNIFIED_WORKSPACE_API are development contracts." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#CCFBF1;strokeColor=#DC2626;strokeWidth=3;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;spacingTop=10;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="530" width="530" height="175" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
